data/azoxy.rda (and the files in data-raw/azoxystrobin/ of the source
repository)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Counts of phytoplankton, zooplankton and macroinvertebrates of the mesocosm
experiment of:

  Amador P, Vega C, Navarro Pacheco NI, Moratalla-Lopez J, Palacios J,
  Crettaz Minaglia MC, Lopez I, Diaz M, Rico A (2024). Effects of the
  fungicide azoxystrobin in two habitats representative of Mediterranean
  coastal wetlands: a mesocosm experiment. Aquatic Toxicology 267, 106828.
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aquatox.2023.106828

